cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DecisionSynth Bench in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DecisionSynth Bench: a decision-relevant memory benchmark for financial-services agents"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "WealthSchema (Capstera)"
    website: "https://www.wealthschema.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/decisionsynth/decisionsynth-bench"
url: "https://decisionsynth.com"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-17
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - memory benchmark
  - synthetic data
  - financial services
  - decision episodes
abstract: >-
  A benchmark evaluating whether agent memory systems can surface
  decision-relevant context: 591 deterministic synthetic decision episodes
  over 71 household archetypes with 1,487 known-answer-by-construction QA
  tasks (direct recall, rationale lookup, precedent search, temporal
  ordering, rule attribution), a dependency-free scoring harness, and a
  maintainer-run scoreboard on a private held-out episode set.
